The PNG files in this directory are built from the Oxygen icon theme
(KDE, https://invent.kde.org/frameworks/oxygen-icons) by tools/fetch-icons.sh.
Some are an Oxygen folder with another Oxygen icon composited over it.
recycle-bin.png and recycle-bin-full.png are not Oxygen's: they are drawn
for this repository (assets/icons-src) and share its licence.

Oxygen icons are released under the GNU Lesser General Public License,
version 3 or later (LGPL-3.0-or-later):
https://www.gnu.org/licenses/lgpl-3.0.html

